---
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<title>GridPermit - California NEM 3.0 Solar & Battery Calculator</title>
	<meta name="description" content="Estimate solar payback timelines, 20-year savings, system sizing, and battery ROI under California NEM 3.0 rules." />
	<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
	<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
	<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
	<div class="top-banner">
		California Incentive Notice: 30% Federal Tax Credit & Local Battery Rebates Available.
	</div>

	<nav class="navbar">
		<div class="nav-container">
			<a href="/" class="brand-logo" aria-label="GridPermit Home">
				<div class="logo-flex">
					<span class="logo-text">Grid<span class="logo-bold">Permit</span></span>
				</div>
			</a>
			<div class="nav-links">
				<a href="#calculator">ROI Calculator</a>
				<a href="/how-it-works">How It Works</a>
				<a href="/about">About</a>
				<a href="/methodology">Methodology</a>
				<a href="/blog/solar-battery-payback-nem3">NEM 3.0 Guide</a>
				<a href="/contact">Contact</a>
			</div>
			<a href="#calculator" class="btn-cta-nav">Run Free Audit</a>
		</div>
	</nav>

	<header class="hero">
		<div class="hero-container">
			<div class="hero-content">
				<div class="badge-pill">Independent California Solar & Battery Tool</div>
				<h1>Estimate Your Solar & Battery Payback Under NEM 3.0 Tariff Rules</h1>
				<p class="hero-lead">Utility export credits dropped significantly under CPUC rules. Get a preliminary payback and financial savings breakdown in 30 seconds.</p>
				<div class="hero-stats">
					<div class="stat-item"><span class="stat-number">NEM 3.0</span><span class="stat-label">CPUC Baseline</span></div>
					<div class="stat-divider"></div>
					<div class="stat-item"><span class="stat-number">30%</span><span class="stat-label">Tax Credit Assumption</span></div>
					<div class="stat-divider"></div>
					<div class="stat-item"><span class="stat-number">Instant</span><span class="stat-label">Calculated Output</span></div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="calculator-glass-card" id="calculator">
				<div class="calc-header">
					<h3>Instant Solar & Battery Payback Estimate</h3>
					<p>Takes only 30 seconds • No contact info required</p>
				</div>
				
				<form id="solar-form">
					<div class="input-field">
						<label for="zip">California ZIP Code</label>
						<input type="text" id="zip" placeholder="e.g. 90210 or 94102" required pattern="[0-9]{5}" />
						<div id="utility-detected" class="utility-pill hidden">Utility Detected: <span id="utility-name">PG&E</span></div>
					</div>
					<div class="input-field">
						<label for="bill">Avg. Monthly Electric Bill ($)</label>
						<input type="number" id="bill" placeholder="e.g. 275" required min="25" max="5000" />
					</div>
					<button type="submit" class="btn-glow-submit" id="calc-btn">
						<span id="btn-text">Calculate NEM 3.0 Savings</span>
					</button>
				</form>

				<!-- Loading Animation Box -->
				<div id="loading-box" class="loading-container hidden">
					<div class="spinner"></div>
					<p id="loading-text">Analyzing NEM 3.0 export values...</p>
				</div>

				<!-- Result Card -->
				<div id="results" class="results-container hidden">
					<div class="results-badge">★ Recommended Strategy: Solar + Battery</div>
					
					<div class="main-savings-card">
						<span class="savings-head">Est. 20-Year Lifetime Savings</span>
						<span class="savings-amount" id="res-lifetime-savings">$38,200</span>
						<span class="savings-sub">Includes 30% Federal Tax Credit Assumptions</span>
					</div>

					<div class="confidence-box">
						<div class="conf-header">
							<span>Estimate Confidence: <strong>Medium</strong></span>
						</div>
						<ul class="conf-list">
							<li>✓ Calculated using ZIP baseline & utility rates</li>
							<li>✓ Modeled with TOU peak discharge rate</li>
							<li>⚡ <em>Excludes roof orientation & shade analysis</em></li>
						</ul>
					</div>

					<div class="results-metrics-grid">
						<div class="metric-card">
							<span class="m-label">Est. System Size</span>
							<span class="m-val" id="res-sys-size">8.6 kW</span>
						</div>
						<div class="metric-card">
							<span class="m-label">Est. Battery Sizing</span>
							<span class="m-val" id="res-bat-size">13.5 kWh</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="results-table-wrap">
						<table class="results-table">
							<thead>
								<tr>
									<th>Configuration</th>
									<th>Payback Period</th>
									<th>Annual Savings</th>
								</tr>
							</thead>
							<tbody>
								<tr>
									<td><strong>Solar Only</strong></td>
									<td id="res-payback-solar">11.4 - 13.1 Yrs</td>
									<td id="res-savings-solar">$1,485/yr</td>
								</tr>
								<tr class="highlight-row">
									<td><strong>Solar + Battery</strong></td>
									<td id="res-payback-battery">7.2 - 8.8 Yrs</td>
									<td id="res-savings-battery">$2,700/yr</td>
								</tr>
							</tbody>
						</table>
					</div>

					<p class="disclaimer-text">*Preliminary calculation based on utility tariff baselines. See our <a href="/methodology" style="color:#2563eb;">Methodology</a> for calculation models.</p>

					<div class="lead-action-box">
						<h4>Next Step: Compare Certified Installers</h4>
						<p>Explore independent installer options in your utility area to confirm physical roof sizing and actual quotes.</p>
						<a href="https://www.energysage.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-green-action-link">
							Compare Online Solar Marketplace →
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</header>

	<footer class="footer">
		<div class="footer-container">
			<p>© 2026 GridPermit. All rights reserved.</p>
			<p class="affiliate-disclosure">
				GridPermit is an independent educational platform that helps California homeowners calculate preliminary solar and battery payback timelines. GridPermit does not install solar systems and is not affiliated with the CPUC, PG&E, SCE, or SDG&E.
			</p>
			<div class="footer-links">
				<a href="/about">About Us</a> | <a href="/how-it-works">How It Works</a> | <a href="/methodology">Methodology</a> | <a href="/contact">Contact</a> | <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> | <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</footer>

	<script is:inline>
		document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
			const zipInput = document.getElementById('zip');
			const utilPill = document.getElementById('utility-detected');
			const utilName = document.getElementById('utility-name');

			if (zipInput) {
				zipInput.addEventListener('input', (e) => {
					const val = e.target.value;
					if (val.length === 5) {
						let utility = 'PG&E';
						if (val.startsWith('92') || val.startsWith('91')) utility = 'SCE';
						if (val.startsWith('919') || val.startsWith('920') || val.startsWith('921')) utility = 'SDG&E';
						
						utilName.innerText = utility;
						utilPill.classList.remove('hidden');
					} else {
						utilPill.classList.add('hidden');
					}
				});
			}

			const form = document.getElementById('solar-form');
			const loadingBox = document.getElementById('loading-box');
			const loadingText = document.getElementById('loading-text');
			const results = document.getElementById('results');

			if (form) {
				form.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
					e.preventDefault();
					form.classList.add('hidden');
					loadingBox.classList.remove('hidden');

					setTimeout(() => { loadingText.innerText = 'Estimating battery utilization...'; }, 900);
					setTimeout(() => { loadingText.innerText = 'Calculating 20-year ROI...'; }, 1700);

					setTimeout(() => {
						loadingBox.classList.add('hidden');
						results.classList.remove('hidden');

						const zipVal = document.getElementById('zip')?.value || '';
						const bill = Number(document.getElementById('bill')?.value || 275);

						const sysKw = (bill / 32).toFixed(1);
						const batKwh = bill > 300 ? '20.0 kWh' : '13.5 kWh';

						const paybackSolar = Math.max(7, Math.round(12 - (bill / 120)));
						const paybackBattery = Math.max(4, Math.round(7 - (bill / 160)));
						
						const annualSavingsSolar = Math.round(bill * 12 * 0.45);
						const annualSavingsBattery = Math.round(bill * 12 * 0.82);

						const cumulativeBattery = annualSavingsBattery * 20;

						document.getElementById('res-sys-size').innerText = sysKw + ' kW';
						document.getElementById('res-bat-size').innerText = batKwh;
						document.getElementById('res-lifetime-savings').innerText = '$' + cumulativeBattery.toLocaleString();

						document.getElementById('res-payback-solar').innerText = paybackSolar + ' - ' + (paybackSolar + 2) + ' Yrs';
						document.getElementById('res-payback-battery').innerText = paybackBattery + ' - ' + (paybackBattery + 2) + ' Yrs';

						document.getElementById('res-savings-solar').innerText = '$' + annualSavingsSolar.toLocaleString() + '/yr';
						document.getElementById('res-savings-battery').innerText = '$' + annualSavingsBattery.toLocaleString() + '/yr';

					}, 2500);
				});
			}
		});
	</script>

	<style>
		:root { --primary: #2563eb; --primary-dark: #1d4ed8; --accent: #10b981; --bg-dark: #0f172a; --bg-slate: #f8fafc; --text-main: #0f172a; --text-muted: #64748b; --border-color: #e2e8f0; --radius: 16px; }
		* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
		body { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, sans-serif; background-color: var(--bg-slate); color: var(--text-main); line-height: 1.6; }
		.top-banner { background: #1e293b; color: #cbd5e1; text-align: center; padding: 0.6rem 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500; }
		.navbar { background: white; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 0.85rem 2rem; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; }
		.nav-container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
		.brand-logo { text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; }
		.logo-text { font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 400; color: #0F172A; }
		.logo-bold { font-weight: 800; }
		.nav-links { display: flex; gap: 1.25rem; }
		.nav-links a { text-decoration: none; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.88rem; }
		.btn-cta-nav { background: var(--primary); color: white; padding: 0.6rem 1.25rem; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; }
		.hero { position: relative; background: #0f172a; padding: 5rem 1.5rem 6rem 1.5rem; color: white; }
		.hero-container { position: relative; z-index: 10; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: center; }
		@media (max-width: 960px) { .hero-container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
		.badge-pill { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2); border: 1px solid rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.3); color: #93c5fd; padding: 0.4rem 1rem; border-radius: 9999px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
		.hero h1 { font-size: 2.8rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
		.hero-lead { font-size: 1.15rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 2rem; max-width: 580px; }
		.hero-stats { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); width: fit-content; }
		.stat-number { display: block; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #38bdf8; }
		.stat-label { font-size: 0.7rem; color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; }
		.stat-divider { width: 1px; height: 35px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); }
		.calculator-glass-card { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 2.25rem; color: var(--text-main); box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35); }
		.calc-header h3 { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 800; }
		.calc-header p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
		.input-field { margin-bottom: 1.25rem; position: relative; }
		.input-field label { display: block; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
		.input-field input { width: 100%; padding: 0.85rem 1rem; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 1rem; }
		.utility-pill { font-size: 0.75rem; color: #166534; background: #dcfce7; padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 0.4rem; display: inline-block; }
		.btn-glow-submit { width: 100%; background: var(--primary); color: white; border: none; padding: 1.1rem; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; cursor: pointer; }
		.hidden { display: none; }
		.loading-container { text-align: center; padding: 2rem 0; }
		.spinner { border: 4px solid #f3f3f3; border-top: 4px solid var(--primary); border-radius: 50%; width: 40px; height: 40px; animation: spin 1s linear infinite; margin: 0 auto 1rem auto; }
		@keyframes spin { 0% { transform: rotate(0deg); } 100% { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
		.results-container { margin-top: 1rem; }
		.results-badge { display: inline-block; background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 800; padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 6px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
		.main-savings-card { background: #1e293b; color: white; padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 12px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
		.savings-head { display: block; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; }
		.savings-amount { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 800; color: #38bdf8; display: block; margin: 0.2rem 0; }
		.savings-sub { font-size: 0.72rem; color: #cbd5e1; }
		.confidence-box { background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 0.85rem; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 0.8rem; }
		.conf-header { font-weight: 700; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
		.conf-list { list-style: none; color: #64748b; }
		.conf-list li { margin-bottom: 0.2rem; }
		.results-metrics-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
		.metric-card { background: #f1f5f9; padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; }
		.m-label { display: block; font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600; }
		.m-val { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--primary); }
		.results-table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
		.results-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.82rem; text-align: left; }
		.results-table th, .results-table td { padding: 0.6rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); }
		.results-table th { background: #f1f5f9; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.72rem; text-transform: uppercase; }
		.highlight-row { background: #f0fdf4; font-weight: 700; color: #166534; }
		.disclaimer-text { font-size: 0.72rem; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; font-style: italic; }
		.lead-action-box { background: var(--bg-dark); color: white; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.25rem; text-align: center; }
		.lead-action-box h4 { font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; }
		.lead-action-box p { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0.3rem 0 0.8rem 0; }
		.btn-green-action-link { display: inline-block; background: var(--accent); color: white; border: none; padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.9rem; text-decoration: none; transition: background 0.2s ease; }
		.btn-green-action-link:hover { background: #059669; }
		.footer { background: var(--bg-dark); color: white; padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); }
		.affiliate-disclosure { font-size: 0.75rem; color: #64748b; max-width: 800px; margin: 0.75rem auto; line-height: 1.4; }
		.footer-links { margin-top: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.85rem; }
		.footer-links a { color: #94a3b8; text-decoration: none; margin: 0 0.5rem; }
	</style>
</body>
</html>
